During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Fire Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if the user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Fire;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Fire Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [Deadly Strikes or Sorcery Damage +20%] to user

